          "content": "Things have been rough lately; you recently moved out on your own. \n\nIt's what you wanted, but it's proven harder than you had anticipated to secure a place to live and meet the other demands of adulthood.\n\nWhat you desperately need is a job, or a reliable source of income.\n\nYou do not have a college degree, but you did get your GED as a teenager. You figure that's better than nothing, right?\n\nYou're still young, with most things still available to you as options for the future. That won't stay true forever though, so don't get too complacent. \n\nYou have an acquaintance who recently confided in you about how she started escorting about six months ago. Since she let you in on this secret, she's been occasionally mentioning how much money she sometimes makes in a day when you guys chat.\n\nIt seems like...a lot. \n\nYou ask her how long it took to make that, and she laughs and tells you only a few hours. Less than half of a shift at a regular full-time job.\n\nThat gives you pause.\n\nYou ask her how she got into this line of work.\n\nShe says she has a girlfriend who is a stripper and cam model, who sometimes sees clients privately and helped show her the ropes.\n\nHmmmm.\n\nWhat are you thinking right about now?",
